들었다. 이들은 상의를 제쳐 젖가슴을 노출했다. 한 학생은 아도르노 뺨에 립스틱 키스를 퍼부었다. 둘은 장미와 튤립 꽃잎을 그에게 마구 뿌렸다. 아도르노는 이들을 뿌리치고 강의실을 빠져나갔고 이후 강의를 취소했다.","date":"2025-08-05T20:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2025/08/06/PEYDZKQX75BQHGBL6EUWI24IPY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"서울대 공대 출신 ‘춤추는 지휘자’","partialText":"","date":"2025-08-05T15:35:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2025/08/06/4BSGFTLJQBEGNC44LTJPLHQVLE/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"민영 YTN·연합뉴스 TV 사장도 3개월 내 물갈이","partialText":"","date":"2025-08-05T08:08:23.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/broadcast-media/2025/08/05/DHO2X2CQC5H7DAV7FLQIPLUEFA/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"눈 마주치면 사게 된다 만화풍 표지의 전성시대","partialText":"","date":"2025-08-05T15:36:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/book/2025/08/06/LJL347PR6RARVGICM4FVVL55SA/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"올 휴가, 극장에 가야 할 이유… 명작들의 귀환","partialText":"","date":"2025-08-05T15:35:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2025/08/06/7ED6L4JV6NFATHB3TBGIU35W5M/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.ch